'''Mentori''' (めんトリ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Mentori Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mentori
|image = E 391.png
|appearance = [[Mentori Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 450¢ - 1,777¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has extremely low health and damage, along with pathetic range and Single Attack.

==Strategy==
Mentori can be beaten by simply using any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]].

